WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.580
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.850 --> 01:43.050
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.120 --> 01:43.690
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.690 --> 01:45.810
[Episode 23]

5
01:52.590 --> 01:53.590
Right here.

6
01:54.000 --> 01:54.950
And this one.

7
01:55.950 --> 01:57.150
Nine people in total,

8
01:57.200 --> 01:58.560
buried in 2 batches.

9
01:58.840 --> 02:00.120
They are all down here.

10
02:00.870 --> 02:01.590
Dig.

11
02:01.590 --> 02:02.350
Let's do it.

12
02:03.040 --> 02:04.560
We at the Divine Constable Bureau

13
02:04.560 --> 02:06.890
have done our fair share of grave digging.

14
02:07.000 --> 02:08.150
Why does it feel like

15
02:08.400 --> 02:09.590
we are thieves today?

16
02:09.590 --> 02:10.520
What are you doing?

17
02:10.520 --> 02:11.120
Stop!

18
02:11.120 --> 02:11.800
My Lord, My Lady,

19
02:11.800 --> 02:12.800
the villagers are coming.

20
02:12.800 --> 02:13.580
Hurry and leave.

21
02:13.580 --> 02:14.680
Let's go!

22
02:14.710 --> 02:16.140
Who told you to dig?

23
02:16.400 --> 02:17.800
What a sin!

24
02:18.470 --> 02:19.730
Everyone, quiet down!

25
02:20.430 --> 02:22.030
I am the village elder of Yin Village.

26
02:22.030 --> 02:23.470
Who exactly are you?

27
02:23.470 --> 02:24.150
How dare you

28
02:24.150 --> 02:25.360
dig up others' graves here?

29
02:25.360 --> 02:25.910
Exactly!

30
02:25.930 --> 02:26.910
Who told you to dig?

31
02:26.910 --> 02:27.800
-Indeed! -Indeed!

32
02:27.800 --> 02:29.360
Quiet, everyone!

33
02:29.400 --> 02:31.150
We are Divine Constables from the Divine Constable Bureau.

34
02:29.770 --> 02:31.190
[Divine Constable Tally]

35
02:31.400 --> 02:32.750
We are digging graves today

36
02:32.750 --> 02:33.870
to investigate a case.

37
02:33.870 --> 02:34.680
What?

38
02:34.800 --> 02:37.000
-Investigate a case? -Divine Constable Bureau? Haven't heard.

39
02:37.000 --> 02:38.960
What do you mean you've never heard of it?

40
02:38.960 --> 02:39.960
Besides,

41
02:40.400 --> 02:42.120
we are not digging your family's graves.

42
02:42.120 --> 02:43.150
The ones buried underneath

43
02:43.150 --> 02:44.800
-are the victims of the murder. -Nonsense!

44
02:44.800 --> 02:46.590
You can't dig anyone's grave!

45
02:46.590 --> 02:47.800
No one's grave should be dug!

46
02:47.800 --> 02:49.329
Everyone, please be quiet!

47
02:49.520 --> 02:52.280
They have already been laid to rest,

48
02:52.310 --> 02:54.190
yet you want to dig them up.

49
02:54.520 --> 02:55.360
You two,

50
02:55.560 --> 02:56.700
please show mercy

51
02:56.730 --> 02:58.110
and stop digging.

52
02:58.130 --> 03:00.050
This is the blessed land

53
03:00.080 --> 03:01.780
-in our village! -Yeah!

54
03:02.560 --> 03:03.530
Yes!

55
03:03.590 --> 03:05.400
If you ruin

56
03:05.420 --> 03:06.800
the feng shui of our ancestors,

57
03:06.800 --> 03:07.990
our Yin Village

58
03:08.020 --> 03:09.750
will suffer the loss of lives!

59
03:09.750 --> 03:10.240
Yes!

60
03:10.240 --> 03:11.190
Exactly!

61
03:11.630 --> 03:12.910
Ancestors,

62
03:13.400 --> 03:15.640
-please don't blame us! -Everyone!

63
03:15.750 --> 03:16.560
Don't kneel!

64
03:17.310 --> 03:18.150
Stop crying and making a scene!

65
03:18.150 --> 03:19.079
Get up now!

66
03:19.310 --> 03:20.400
Ancestors, please forgive us!

67
03:20.400 --> 03:21.400
-Jiuying. -Get up!

68
03:21.400 --> 03:22.190
Get ready.

69
03:22.400 --> 03:23.280
Li Si,

70
03:23.400 --> 03:24.910
what are these for?

71
03:25.030 --> 03:26.760
This is a peerless martial art.

72
03:26.800 --> 03:27.930
It's very powerful.

73
03:28.590 --> 03:30.850
"One mouth narrates tales of millennia;

74
03:30.960 --> 03:33.000
a pair of hands manipulates millions of soldiers."

75
03:33.000 --> 03:34.460
That's what it describes.

76
03:34.560 --> 03:36.800
All props are controlled by one person.

77
03:36.870 --> 03:37.680
They can sing,

78
03:37.800 --> 03:38.560
act,

79
03:38.560 --> 03:39.360
fight,

80
03:39.400 --> 03:40.190
and recite.

81
03:40.750 --> 03:42.800
If that's not a peerless martial art, what is it?

82
03:42.800 --> 03:44.590
Murders are rampant in Gutan County.

83
03:44.590 --> 03:45.840
If we don't exhume the bodies for autopsies

84
03:45.840 --> 03:47.190
and catch the murderer,

85
03:47.190 --> 03:48.630
none of us will have a peaceful day!

86
03:48.630 --> 03:49.120
Exactly!

87
03:49.120 --> 03:49.980
What?

88
03:50.030 --> 03:51.190
Exhume the bodies for autopsies?

89
03:51.190 --> 03:52.560
That will bring even less peace!

90
03:52.560 --> 03:53.560
-No! -No!

91
03:53.560 --> 03:54.710
Absolutely not!

92
03:54.750 --> 03:56.120
Even if the village elder agrees,

93
03:56.120 --> 03:57.150
we won't allow it!

94
03:57.150 --> 03:58.360
-No! -No!

95
03:58.590 --> 04:00.000
Everyone, please calm down!

96
04:00.000 --> 04:02.520
-Calm down, everyone! -No! No!

97
04:02.520 --> 04:03.800
How can this be?

98
04:03.800 --> 04:04.750
We refuse!

99
04:04.770 --> 04:05.680
Come down.

100
04:08.400 --> 04:09.190
Jiuying,

101
04:09.840 --> 04:11.190
the biggest taboo

102
04:11.190 --> 04:12.150
in shadow puppetry

103
04:12.150 --> 04:14.710
-is to tie the strings together. -Please calm down!

104
04:14.710 --> 04:16.720
-These strings look tough. -Calm down!

105
04:16.720 --> 04:18.209
-But if they're all entangled... -You can't dig!

106
04:18.209 --> 04:19.560
And rub against each other,

107
04:19.560 --> 04:21.070
they will easily snap.

108
04:21.800 --> 04:22.700
But

109
04:22.830 --> 04:24.090
watching them spin...

110
04:25.750 --> 04:26.640
But

111
04:26.720 --> 04:27.720
watching them spin

112
04:27.720 --> 04:28.750
is so much fun.

113
04:29.120 --> 04:29.920
Naughty.

114
04:31.360 --> 04:33.190
You absolutely can't dig!

115
04:33.240 --> 04:34.120
Watch me.

116
04:34.390 --> 04:36.120
I have something even more fun.

117
04:36.430 --> 04:37.630
Absolutely no digging!

118
04:37.630 --> 04:38.510
No digging!

119
04:53.310 --> 04:54.240
Everyone, calm down

120
04:54.240 --> 04:55.120
and listen to me!

121
04:55.120 --> 04:55.920
Stop arguing!

122
04:57.000 --> 04:58.190
Don't do anything reckless!

123
04:58.190 --> 04:59.120
Father! Father!

124
04:59.360 --> 05:00.160
Look!

125
05:02.720 --> 05:03.510
This...

126
05:04.120 --> 05:05.050
Shadow puppets!

127
05:08.830 --> 05:11.190
The shadow puppet monsters killed someone!

128
05:11.190 --> 05:13.120
The shadow puppet monsters! Run!

129
05:13.560 --> 05:14.390
Hurry!

130
05:14.510 --> 05:15.360
Run!

131
05:16.750 --> 05:17.560
Run!

132
05:22.560 --> 05:23.920
Playing tricks.

133
05:24.160 --> 05:25.120
Perfect timing.

134
05:25.750 --> 05:28.010
I'll smash you to death with this shovel!

135
05:36.830 --> 05:37.560
Isn't this just

136
05:37.560 --> 05:39.090
an ordinary shadow puppet?

137
05:41.430 --> 05:42.680
Which unlucky fool

138
05:43.120 --> 05:44.310
came to the graveyard

139
05:44.310 --> 05:46.190
to sing opera in the middle of the night?

140
05:46.190 --> 05:48.040
Good thing we hid here.

141
05:48.040 --> 05:49.000
Otherwise,

142
05:49.000 --> 05:50.360
Yan Sanhuo would have

143
05:50.360 --> 05:51.640
smashed us to death on the spot.

144
05:51.640 --> 05:52.810
Yan, let's continue.

145
05:52.810 --> 05:54.000
Why scare them?

146
05:54.120 --> 05:55.520
If we hadn't scared them,

147
05:55.560 --> 05:57.800
how would those villagers have run away?

148
05:57.800 --> 05:59.190
If they were there,

149
05:59.240 --> 06:00.500
how could your Zhenzhu

150
06:00.600 --> 06:01.750
examine the bodies?

151
06:03.000 --> 06:04.000
I think

152
06:04.160 --> 06:05.920
they must have been set up

153
06:05.950 --> 06:07.390
by Du Zhongtao.

154
06:07.750 --> 06:09.750
People came right when they started digging.

155
06:09.750 --> 06:12.120
How could it be such a coincidence?

156
06:13.920 --> 06:15.800
Then

157
06:15.920 --> 06:17.120
what's the next step?

158
06:17.800 --> 06:19.400
After the bodies are dug out,

159
06:19.430 --> 06:21.390
they'll definitely be carried back to the government office for examination.

160
06:21.390 --> 06:22.520
When the time comes,

161
06:23.430 --> 06:25.190
you just keep an eye on it there.

162
06:25.310 --> 06:26.270
You must firmly remember

163
06:26.270 --> 06:27.390
every word

164
06:27.560 --> 06:29.270
your Zhenzhu says,

165
06:29.390 --> 06:30.560
and then tell me.

166
06:32.240 --> 06:33.040
Let's go.

167
06:34.090 --> 06:37.420
[Gutan County Government]

168
06:39.800 --> 06:41.159
These 9 victims

169
06:41.240 --> 06:43.700
all have a perforating wound on their necks.

170
06:44.430 --> 06:46.560
The clothes are soaked in blood,

171
06:47.000 --> 06:49.120
indicating massive blood loss.

172
06:49.510 --> 06:50.480
That is to say,

173
06:50.600 --> 06:51.600
these 9 people

174
06:51.620 --> 06:53.710
all died of blood loss

175
06:53.920 --> 06:56.320
after their necks were instantly pierced.

176
06:56.480 --> 06:57.270
Jiuying?

177
06:58.560 --> 06:59.560
Who let you in?

178
07:00.000 --> 07:01.190
It's so scary in here.

179
07:01.190 --> 07:01.950
Get out.

180
07:02.120 --> 07:03.120
I won't get out.

181
07:03.120 --> 07:04.050
I want to listen.

182
07:04.510 --> 07:05.310
Listen?

183
07:05.800 --> 07:06.930
Can you understand?

184
07:08.390 --> 07:09.390
These 9 people

185
07:09.390 --> 07:10.720
all have a perforating wound on their necks.

186
07:10.720 --> 07:12.310
The clothes are soaked with blood,

187
07:12.310 --> 07:13.750
indicating massive blood loss.

188
07:13.750 --> 07:14.960
That is to say, these 9 people

189
07:14.960 --> 07:16.520
had their necks pierced instantly

190
07:16.520 --> 07:17.520
and bled to death.

191
07:18.430 --> 07:19.590
Oh my goodness.

192
07:20.920 --> 07:21.850
What's going on?

193
07:22.830 --> 07:23.750
I think

194
07:24.040 --> 07:25.020
maybe Jiuying

195
07:25.040 --> 07:26.390
has an extraordinary talent

196
07:26.390 --> 07:27.800
for examining bodies.

197
07:28.800 --> 07:29.800
Don't forget,

198
07:29.920 --> 07:32.110
she's the one who completely pieced together

199
07:32.110 --> 07:33.480
her mother's bones.

200
07:33.950 --> 07:35.510
She's simply self-taught.

201
07:37.190 --> 07:38.120
Yeah.

202
07:39.000 --> 07:41.070
Maybe we can really train a genius

203
07:41.120 --> 07:43.159
for our bureau in the future.

204
07:44.600 --> 07:46.120
Jiuying, come here.

205
07:47.560 --> 07:49.420
Stand here and listen carefully.

206
07:49.680 --> 07:50.480
Go on.

207
07:55.159 --> 07:56.380
The deceased has cyanotic lips

208
07:56.380 --> 07:57.360
and a pale face.

209
07:57.750 --> 07:59.390
The clothes are soiled with excrement,

210
07:59.390 --> 08:01.600
indicating incontinence before death.

211
08:01.600 --> 08:02.750
It indeed matches

212
08:02.750 --> 08:04.310
the symptoms of death from blood loss.

213
08:04.310 --> 08:05.600
Can you tell

214
08:05.600 --> 08:07.190
what pierced them?

215
08:11.070 --> 08:11.930
Good question.

216
08:13.360 --> 08:15.120
The edges of the wounds are irregular,

217
08:15.120 --> 08:16.510
and the shapes are inconsistent.

218
08:16.510 --> 08:17.600
I have never seen

219
08:17.720 --> 08:18.850
such wounds before.

220
08:19.160 --> 08:20.800
It's hard to identify for now.

221
08:20.800 --> 08:21.600
However,

222
08:21.920 --> 08:22.790
the 9 of them

223
08:22.820 --> 08:24.160
share a common trait.

224
08:28.160 --> 08:28.950
It's empty?

225
08:30.780 --> 08:31.510
I have examined these 9 people

226
08:31.510 --> 08:32.950
one by one.

227
08:33.150 --> 08:34.960
Their hearts and livers are all missing.

228
08:34.960 --> 08:37.090
They were deliberately hollowed out.

229
08:37.909 --> 08:39.150
Do you remember

230
08:39.360 --> 08:40.590
that madman on Panlong Street

231
08:40.590 --> 08:41.549
yesterday?

232
08:42.150 --> 08:44.000
The shadow puppet ghost is here!

233
08:44.150 --> 08:45.350
Cutting out hearts

234
08:45.600 --> 08:46.630
and digging out livers!

235
08:46.630 --> 08:48.690
Nine nines return to one!

236
08:51.390 --> 08:52.390
Could it really be

237
08:52.600 --> 08:54.890
Yin Jie's vengeful spirit

238
08:55.120 --> 08:57.120
returning for revenge to resurrect

239
08:57.200 --> 08:58.910
his wife and child?

240
08:59.440 --> 09:01.030
Don't scare the kid.

241
09:02.240 --> 09:04.360
It's only our first day in Gutan County.

242
09:04.360 --> 09:05.300
All clues revolve

243
09:05.300 --> 09:07.230
around the Yaotai Immortal Dream.

244
09:07.840 --> 09:08.940
Especially the shadow puppet

245
09:08.940 --> 09:10.600
that appeared in the graveyard last night.

246
09:10.600 --> 09:12.570
Its timing and location

247
09:12.790 --> 09:13.790
were too bizarre.

248
09:14.440 --> 09:15.610
So you mean...

249
09:16.720 --> 09:18.840
we still need to start investigating from the shadow puppets.

250
09:18.840 --> 09:20.260
Let's report the autopsy results

251
09:20.260 --> 09:21.510
to His Highness Prince Ping first.

252
09:21.510 --> 09:22.730
Then we will start investigating

253
09:22.730 --> 09:24.130
from the shadow puppets.

254
09:24.320 --> 09:25.120
All right.

255
09:31.030 --> 09:31.750
Excuse me, you two.

256
09:31.750 --> 09:32.390
Is this—

257
09:32.390 --> 09:33.440
-I don't know. I don't know. -Miss,

258
09:33.440 --> 09:34.200
do you know where they sell

259
09:34.200 --> 09:35.150
this kind of shadow puppet?

260
09:35.150 --> 09:36.200
Do you recognize this?

261
09:36.200 --> 09:37.600
The shop ahead is the one.

262
09:38.120 --> 09:39.000
Thank you.

263
09:39.390 --> 09:40.320
Gently, gently.

264
09:40.510 --> 09:41.600
Handle with care.

265
09:47.320 --> 09:48.150
Boss,

266
09:48.390 --> 09:49.460
why are you no longer selling

267
09:49.460 --> 09:51.440
these perfectly good shadow puppets?

268
09:51.440 --> 09:52.600
It's all because of

269
09:52.600 --> 09:53.720
the murders these past few days.

270
09:53.720 --> 09:55.580
Who would buy shadow puppets now?

271
09:55.840 --> 09:56.750
This business

272
09:56.750 --> 09:57.960
is impossible to run.

273
09:58.000 --> 09:59.600
I've sold shadow puppets all my life.

274
09:59.600 --> 10:01.600
How am I supposed to live from now on?

275
10:01.630 --> 10:02.470
Hurry up,

276
10:02.490 --> 10:03.200
load the cart.

277
10:03.200 --> 10:03.440
Yes.

278
10:03.440 --> 10:04.440
Handle everything with care.

279
10:04.440 --> 10:05.120
Okay.

280
10:12.870 --> 10:15.720
-Boy. Alright. -Sing over osmanthus wine.

281
10:15.790 --> 10:17.840
-Moonlight shines on glazed goblets. -I...

282
10:17.840 --> 10:18.910
-The wine in Gutan... -No, listen to me.

283
10:18.910 --> 10:20.150
Sweet osmanthus scent.

284
10:20.150 --> 10:22.120
Sir, which one would you like?

285
10:22.150 --> 10:23.320
Let me ask you,

286
10:23.510 --> 10:24.550
didn't this place

287
10:24.580 --> 10:26.150
sell shadow puppets before?

288
10:26.150 --> 10:27.700
Why is it selling wine now?

289
10:27.750 --> 10:29.390
You have a good eye, Sir.

290
10:29.390 --> 10:31.200
-Look at this glazed goblet. -I...

291
10:31.200 --> 10:32.360
Crystal clear,

292
10:32.360 --> 10:33.390
with superb craftsmanship.

293
10:33.390 --> 10:34.520
How many do you want?

294
10:34.750 --> 10:35.870
How many?

295
10:36.360 --> 10:37.390
I want this.

296
10:38.150 --> 10:39.750
Did you use to sell shadow puppets?

297
10:39.750 --> 10:40.960
Have you changed to selling wine?

298
10:40.960 --> 10:41.880
Sir,

299
10:41.960 --> 10:42.790
if you're not buying wine,

300
10:42.790 --> 10:44.080
please take this thing

301
10:44.110 --> 10:44.910
and leave quickly.

302
10:44.910 --> 10:46.390
Don't affect our business.

303
10:46.390 --> 10:46.970
How about this?

304
10:46.970 --> 10:47.940
Just tell me

305
10:47.960 --> 10:49.270
where the shadow puppet shop

306
10:49.270 --> 10:50.390
moved to,

307
10:50.390 --> 10:51.990
and I'll leave immediately.

308
10:53.320 --> 10:54.150
Leave, leave, leave.

309
10:54.150 --> 10:54.960
Leave, leave, leave.

310
10:54.960 --> 10:55.600
Why are you pushing me?

311
10:55.600 --> 10:56.240
Leave quickly.

312
10:56.240 --> 10:57.600
-Don't disturb my business! -You don't know me?

313
10:56.870 --> 10:59.560
[Xiangrui Shadow Puppet Shop]

314
10:58.790 --> 10:59.600
Bosss,

315
10:59.790 --> 11:00.720
look carefully.

316
11:02.120 --> 11:03.250
Do you recognize it?

317
11:03.360 --> 11:03.960
That's right.

318
11:03.960 --> 11:05.060
It is my shadow puppet.

319
11:05.060 --> 11:06.120
There's none uglier than it.

320
11:06.120 --> 11:06.960
Yours?

321
11:07.150 --> 11:07.960
Of course.

322
11:08.030 --> 11:09.320
Great.

323
11:11.240 --> 11:12.150
When was it sold?

324
11:12.150 --> 11:13.200
Yesterday at dusk.

325
11:13.200 --> 11:14.910
I was about to close the shop

326
11:14.910 --> 11:15.790
when a girl came

327
11:15.790 --> 11:17.720
and picked the ugliest one.

328
11:17.720 --> 11:18.790
If you didn't look closely,

329
11:18.790 --> 11:20.190
you'd think she was a boy.

330
11:20.630 --> 11:21.550
Xia Jiuying?

331
11:23.390 --> 11:25.510
Did she say why she bought the shadow puppet?

332
11:25.510 --> 11:26.660
She said...

333
11:27.510 --> 11:28.960
She said her brother asked her to buy it.

334
11:28.960 --> 11:29.960
Her brother?

335
11:34.550 --> 11:35.720
How did she pay?

336
11:36.560 --> 11:37.550
She used banknotes.

337
11:37.550 --> 11:39.520
She was quite generous.

338
11:39.550 --> 11:41.480
She didn't even want the change.

339
11:41.630 --> 11:42.550
Let me see.

340
11:44.200 --> 11:45.000
This...

341
11:48.070 --> 11:49.020
[Divine Constable Tally]

342
11:53.600 --> 11:54.390
My Lord.

343
11:55.600 --> 11:56.240
Well...

344
11:56.260 --> 11:57.720
Three notes, not one less.

345
11:58.510 --> 11:59.320
Look.

346
11:59.420 --> 12:01.250
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

347
12:02.030 --> 12:03.960
I am Constable Iron of Divine Constable Bureau in Tianhuang City.

348
12:02.450 --> 12:03.590
[Divine Constable Tally]

349
12:03.960 --> 12:04.790
Now,

350
12:05.000 --> 12:06.720
I need to borrow your banknotes.

351
12:06.720 --> 12:07.510
Okay.

352
12:08.470 --> 12:12.220
[Xiangrui Shadow Puppet Shop]

353
12:08.910 --> 12:09.720
My Lord!

354
12:11.600 --> 12:12.390
My Lord!

355
12:12.790 --> 12:15.050
When will you return the banknotes to me?

356
12:15.120 --> 12:15.910
My Lord!

357
12:17.150 --> 12:18.390
Empty joy.

358
12:27.470 --> 12:29.270
[Divine Constable Tally]

359
12:44.240 --> 12:45.250
Time

360
12:45.750 --> 12:48.420
is not a good medicine to heal scars.

361
12:49.720 --> 12:50.510
Get up!

362
13:07.320 --> 13:09.790
Bury your parents first,

363
13:10.320 --> 13:11.870
then go to Gutan County.

364
13:12.360 --> 13:14.490
There is someone you want to see there.

365
13:32.540 --> 13:33.570
[100 taels]

366
13:34.750 --> 13:36.150
Baoyuan Bank.

367
13:36.960 --> 13:37.840
Isn't this the largest bank

368
13:37.840 --> 13:39.030
in Tianhuang City?

369
13:39.030 --> 13:40.910
It's no surprise these notes ended up here.

370
13:40.910 --> 13:42.150
Is there anything strange about it?

371
13:42.150 --> 13:42.960
Hand it over.

372
13:49.360 --> 13:50.150
This is...

373
13:52.730 --> 13:53.630
[100 taels]

374
14:01.840 --> 14:03.570
The Star-Gathering Pavilion?

375
14:04.550 --> 14:05.360
So,

376
14:05.910 --> 14:07.150
the one who bought the shadow puppets

377
14:07.150 --> 14:08.390
and messed around in the graveyard last night

378
14:08.390 --> 14:09.200
was Li Si.

379
14:10.360 --> 14:11.510
Li Si is still alive.

380
14:12.960 --> 14:14.020
What did I tell you?

381
14:14.150 --> 14:16.150
That kid wouldn't go down so easily.

382
14:19.440 --> 14:20.320
Well, well.

383
14:21.320 --> 14:23.120
So you two have been in cahoots all along,

384
14:23.120 --> 14:23.840
keeping us in the dark,

385
14:23.840 --> 14:24.570
haven't you?

386
14:24.960 --> 14:25.750
Jiuying,

387
14:25.790 --> 14:27.150
have you seen Li Si?

388
14:27.390 --> 14:28.910
We are on a secret mission.

389
14:28.960 --> 14:30.200
I can't tell you.

390
14:32.550 --> 14:33.320
So,

391
14:33.340 --> 14:35.070
Li Si also came to Gutan County.

392
14:35.200 --> 14:36.150
Last night, he

393
14:36.360 --> 14:37.250
used the shadow puppets

394
14:37.250 --> 14:38.510
to disperse the villagers for us.

395
14:38.510 --> 14:39.030
This means

396
14:39.030 --> 14:39.740
he has been keeping an eye on

397
14:39.740 --> 14:40.870
this case all along.

398
14:43.030 --> 14:44.150
We are in the open,

399
14:44.910 --> 14:46.040
and he is in the dark.

400
14:46.150 --> 14:47.240
Not to mention

401
14:47.600 --> 14:49.600
he has Xia Jiuying as his informant.

402
14:49.960 --> 14:51.120
He probably knows

403
14:51.440 --> 14:52.790
much more than we do.

404
14:53.550 --> 14:55.350
Where do you think he will start?

405
14:56.510 --> 14:59.960
The most crucial place

406
15:00.910 --> 15:02.790
concerning the safety of the Grand Heir Apparent.

407
15:02.790 --> 15:04.000
Golden Dragon Pavilion.

408
15:04.000 --> 15:05.600
With Li Qingyang's skills,

409
15:06.550 --> 15:07.910
even if we can't get in,

410
15:08.150 --> 15:09.720
it doesn't mean he can't.

411
15:09.720 --> 15:10.920
He might have already

412
15:11.000 --> 15:12.150
beaten us to it.

413
15:13.150 --> 15:14.360
We can't fall behind either.

414
15:14.360 --> 15:14.840
Alright.

415
15:14.840 --> 15:15.550
I'll go

416
15:15.550 --> 15:17.240
return the banknotes to the boss first.

417
15:17.240 --> 15:18.270
The boss

418
15:18.440 --> 15:19.600
was really about to cry.

419
15:19.600 --> 15:20.240
Let's go.

420
15:21.410 --> 15:22.200
Let's go.

421
15:27.630 --> 15:28.440
Li Si,

422
15:29.390 --> 15:30.920
you really are still alive.

423
15:32.140 --> 15:35.070
[Department of Food Affairs]

424
15:32.510 --> 15:33.790
His Highness the Grand Heir Apparent

425
15:33.790 --> 15:35.270
is arriving tomorrow.

426
15:35.510 --> 15:36.870
All his meals

427
15:36.960 --> 15:39.150
are the responsibility of our Department of Food Affairs.

428
15:39.150 --> 15:41.070
If anything goes wrong

429
15:41.150 --> 15:43.210
with the food going into his mouth...

430
15:46.390 --> 15:47.450
To put it lightly,

431
15:47.470 --> 15:48.960
it's a dereliction of duty.

432
15:48.960 --> 15:50.020
To put it severely,

433
15:50.240 --> 15:52.360
it's murdering the Grand Heir Apparent,

434
15:52.360 --> 15:54.960
which means execution for your entire family.

435
15:54.980 --> 15:56.380
The General has arrived!

436
16:00.030 --> 16:02.140
I'm Liu Xianneng, Director of the Golden Dragon Pavilion,

437
16:02.140 --> 16:03.790
paying my respects to you, General Sui.

438
16:03.790 --> 16:04.600
General Sui,

439
16:04.600 --> 16:06.930
why have you come to the kitchen in person?

440
16:07.200 --> 16:08.440
You are the director?

441
16:08.750 --> 16:09.510
Perfect.

442
16:09.510 --> 16:11.510
You are exactly who I'm looking for.

443
16:11.600 --> 16:13.870
What do you mean by that, General?

444
16:13.960 --> 16:14.790
Let me ask you.

445
16:15.440 --> 16:16.660
It's one thing that your Golden Dragon Pavilion

446
16:16.660 --> 16:18.240
doesn't allow meat,

447
16:18.240 --> 16:20.000
but why is even wine forbidden?

448
16:20.440 --> 16:21.550
Please don't take offense, General.

449
16:21.550 --> 16:23.110
Since ancient times, one must clear the mind

450
16:23.110 --> 16:24.060
and limit desires in a place of cultivation

451
16:24.060 --> 16:25.390
to achieve immortality.

452
16:25.390 --> 16:27.320
Wine and meat are poison to the body,

453
16:27.320 --> 16:28.980
so we dare not partake of them.

454
16:31.150 --> 16:32.870
Those are rules only you cultivators

455
16:32.870 --> 16:33.630
follow.

456
16:33.630 --> 16:35.510
I have no desire to become an immortal.

457
16:35.510 --> 16:36.420
Why should I suffer

458
16:36.420 --> 16:37.750
this nonsense with you?

459
16:37.790 --> 16:38.600
Ji Xun!

460
16:38.870 --> 16:39.600
I am here.

461
16:39.600 --> 16:40.600
Search the place!

462
16:40.960 --> 16:42.910
I don't believe there isn't a single jar of wine

463
16:42.910 --> 16:43.750
in this kitchen!

464
16:43.750 --> 16:44.440
Director Liu.

465
16:44.440 --> 16:45.120
Men,

466
16:45.120 --> 16:45.790
search everywhere!

467
16:45.790 --> 16:46.480
-Yes! -Yes!

468
16:49.000 --> 16:50.130
Calm down, General.

469
16:50.150 --> 16:50.960
Eating vegetarian and abstaining from alcohol

470
16:50.960 --> 16:52.200
are Golden Dragon Pavilion's rules.

471
16:52.200 --> 16:53.240
Everyone staying in the pavilion

472
16:53.240 --> 16:54.490
must obey them.

473
16:54.550 --> 16:56.510
We lowly ones have no choice.

474
16:57.030 --> 16:57.890
How about this?

475
16:58.120 --> 16:58.990
There are a few good taverns

476
16:58.990 --> 17:00.200
in the county town.

477
17:00.200 --> 17:01.550
If you don't mind,

478
17:02.000 --> 17:02.790
I am

479
17:02.960 --> 17:04.490
willing to show you the way.

480
17:06.720 --> 17:07.790
So you mean,

481
17:08.310 --> 17:10.200
with the Grand Heir Apparent arriving soon,

482
17:10.200 --> 17:10.869
I,

483
17:10.900 --> 17:12.339
the commander responsible for his protection,

484
17:12.339 --> 17:13.960
should go out drinking and making merry?

485
17:13.960 --> 17:15.160
If word gets out,

486
17:15.310 --> 17:16.589
wouldn't I become

487
17:16.720 --> 17:18.369
a useless drunkard who disregards

488
17:18.369 --> 17:19.750
the Grand Heir Apparent's safety?

489
17:19.750 --> 17:21.140
How could you come up with

490
17:21.140 --> 17:22.400
such a vicious scheme?

491
17:22.400 --> 17:24.690
I-I didn't mean that.

492
17:24.720 --> 17:26.790
I think you harbor evil intentions

493
17:26.790 --> 17:27.760
and have ulterior motives!

494
17:27.760 --> 17:28.870
Xiaoshan!

495
17:32.790 --> 17:33.900
Stop!

496
17:35.960 --> 17:37.160
Who is making a racket

497
17:37.440 --> 17:38.970
in this peaceful place?

498
17:42.550 --> 17:43.610
Master Changping.

499
17:44.600 --> 17:47.190
[Changpingzi, Principal of the Golden Dragon Pavilion]

500
17:48.960 --> 17:50.880
I'm just on a routine patrol.

501
17:50.960 --> 17:52.720
Why did it alarm you, Master?

502
17:53.400 --> 17:54.790
So it's you, General.

503
17:55.750 --> 17:56.550
Who is he?

504
17:57.750 --> 18:00.720
Changpingzi, Principal of the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

505
18:00.720 --> 18:02.110
When the abbot is in seclusion,

506
18:02.110 --> 18:03.590
he's in charge of everything

507
18:03.590 --> 18:04.790
here.

508
18:04.960 --> 18:07.270
Did our disciples misbehave

509
18:07.310 --> 18:08.640
and anger you, General?

510
18:09.750 --> 18:11.440
Just a little misunderstanding.

511
18:11.440 --> 18:12.770
Nothing to worry about.

512
18:13.030 --> 18:14.760
But since you're here, Master,

513
18:15.160 --> 18:17.550
I do have a presumptuous request.

514
18:18.590 --> 18:20.160
I hope you can grant it.

515
18:33.200 --> 18:36.400
You want to see the Dragon Saliva Crystal, General?

516
18:37.160 --> 18:38.390
The Grand Heir Apparent is coming

517
18:38.390 --> 18:39.960
to ask for the crystal soon.

518
18:40.590 --> 18:43.160
The Xuanjie Battalion has been appointed by the Emperor

519
18:43.160 --> 18:44.550
to protect him.

520
18:45.200 --> 18:46.740
To be safe,

521
18:46.880 --> 18:47.810
we have to take a look

522
18:47.810 --> 18:49.480
at the treasure in advance.

523
18:50.200 --> 18:52.000
It's not for my own sake,

524
18:52.000 --> 18:53.650
but for the Great Shi Empire,

525
18:53.790 --> 18:55.270
I have to be careful.

526
18:58.550 --> 18:59.960
What do you mean, Master?

527
19:00.720 --> 19:02.190
Do you think

528
19:02.220 --> 19:03.310
I am not qualified?

529
19:03.400 --> 19:05.060
You misunderstood, General.

530
19:05.240 --> 19:06.200
It's not that

531
19:06.220 --> 19:08.200
I don't want to show it to you,

532
19:08.310 --> 19:09.110
but

533
19:09.400 --> 19:10.850
there is no such thing as

534
19:10.880 --> 19:12.540
Dragon Saliva Crystal at all.

535
19:13.750 --> 19:14.720
What did you say?

536
19:16.030 --> 19:18.660
There is no Dragon Saliva Crystal?

537
19:18.920 --> 19:20.830
Since the establishment of the Golden Dragon Pavilion,

538
19:20.830 --> 19:22.720
there has never been such a thing.

539
19:23.030 --> 19:25.290
The golden dragon breathing the spirit of heaven and earth,

540
19:25.290 --> 19:26.640
and its saliva turning into crystal

541
19:26.640 --> 19:27.570
are just visions

542
19:27.640 --> 19:29.790
woven by

543
19:29.790 --> 19:31.480
devout men and women.

544
19:31.720 --> 19:33.180
People spread the rumors,

545
19:33.200 --> 19:34.790
and everyone believed them to be true.

546
19:34.790 --> 19:37.510
If you don't want to show it to me,

547
19:37.750 --> 19:38.680
you don't have to

548
19:38.700 --> 19:40.750
make up such lies to deceive me.

549
19:41.400 --> 19:44.200
The Dragon Saliva Crystal must be in the pavilion.

550
19:44.750 --> 19:45.680
Otherwise,

551
19:45.790 --> 19:47.420
wouldn't it be ridiculous

552
19:47.440 --> 19:48.750
for His Highness the Grand Heir Apparent

553
19:48.750 --> 19:50.920
to come in person for the medicine?

554
19:51.440 --> 19:54.350
All living beings can't attain the true Way

555
19:54.510 --> 19:56.510
because of their delusional minds.

556
19:56.510 --> 19:57.310
General,

557
19:57.550 --> 19:58.720
I actually

558
19:58.790 --> 20:00.680
have a presumptuous request.

559
20:02.590 --> 20:03.720
Please speak.

560
20:04.350 --> 20:05.480
Please

561
20:06.000 --> 20:07.550
move out of Langyue Studio.

562
20:07.790 --> 20:10.000
I am a pillar of the imperial court,

563
20:10.000 --> 20:11.240
with countless military merits.

564
20:11.240 --> 20:13.400
Can't I even stay in a side pavilion?

565
20:15.310 --> 20:17.000
General, you may not know this.

566
20:17.000 --> 20:19.550
Last night, I observed the stars.

567
20:20.110 --> 20:21.960
The Moon occulting the Net Mansion

568
20:21.960 --> 20:23.510
is a terrible omen.

569
20:23.540 --> 20:26.240
The Yin energy in the Langyue Studio is already strong.

570
20:26.240 --> 20:27.400
On ordinary days,

571
20:27.400 --> 20:28.750
it would be fine to stay there.

572
20:28.750 --> 20:31.550
But tomorrow happens to be the fifteenth.

573
20:31.960 --> 20:33.350
Solar eclipses occur on the new moon,

574
20:33.350 --> 20:35.160
and lunar eclipses on the full moon.

575
20:35.160 --> 20:36.910
If we encounter a lunar eclipse,

576
20:36.910 --> 20:38.370
Yin and Yang will reverse,

577
20:38.400 --> 20:39.930
and cold evil will prevail.

578
20:40.310 --> 20:41.170
I'm afraid

579
20:41.510 --> 20:43.510
there might be some unclean things.

580
20:44.000 --> 20:46.160
I am forged in iron and blood.

581
20:46.400 --> 20:48.350
The last thing I lack is Yang energy.

582
20:48.350 --> 20:50.920
Even 100 ghosts can't get close to me.

583
20:52.000 --> 20:53.140
If there really are any

584
20:53.140 --> 20:54.160
unclean things,

585
20:54.510 --> 20:57.040
I will just cut them down for you with my blade.

586
21:02.400 --> 21:04.310
Since you insist,

587
21:04.550 --> 21:06.400
I'll let your wish be granted.

588
21:13.790 --> 21:15.270
Just cheap tricks.

589
21:24.830 --> 21:26.960
A hundred ghosts can hardly get close.

590
21:26.960 --> 21:28.000
Then do you know

591
21:28.790 --> 21:30.120
that the greatest ghost

592
21:30.440 --> 21:31.720
is your inner demon?

593
21:36.910 --> 21:39.370
[Langyue Studio]

594
21:44.200 --> 21:44.920
General.

595
22:01.720 --> 22:02.590
All right, all right.

596
22:02.590 --> 22:03.350
Come here,

597
22:04.030 --> 22:04.830
all of you.

598
22:07.640 --> 22:08.590
Let me ask you,

599
22:09.200 --> 22:10.370
has anyone among you

600
22:10.390 --> 22:12.630
seen the Dragon Saliva Crystal?

601
22:16.030 --> 22:17.430
Changpingzi said

602
22:17.460 --> 22:18.830
the Dragon Saliva Crystal

603
22:18.830 --> 22:20.550
is merely a legend.

604
22:20.920 --> 22:21.980
Is that true or not?

605
22:25.790 --> 22:26.550
You, tell me.

606
22:27.830 --> 22:29.200
Reporting to you, General,

607
22:29.200 --> 22:31.480
I-I do not know.

608
22:32.880 --> 22:33.680
My Lord,

609
22:34.310 --> 22:35.200
I know.

610
22:37.310 --> 22:39.110
I heard that the Dragon Saliva Crystal

611
22:39.110 --> 22:40.790
is hidden in the Golden Dragon Hall.

612
22:40.790 --> 22:41.640
Li Xiaosi,

613
22:41.830 --> 22:43.030
do not speak nonsense!

614
22:43.030 --> 22:44.560
I am not speaking nonsense.

615
22:44.790 --> 22:46.270
Is this not what you said?

616
22:46.510 --> 22:47.240
My Lord,

617
22:47.240 --> 22:48.440
h-he is new here

618
22:48.440 --> 22:49.590
and just repeating hearsay.

619
22:49.590 --> 22:51.250
Do not listen to his nonsense.

620
22:53.400 --> 22:54.800
I have spoken out of turn.

621
22:56.350 --> 22:57.200
Enough.

622
22:57.200 --> 22:58.200
You may all leave.

623
22:58.440 --> 22:59.960
I am going to rest.

624
23:00.440 --> 23:01.240
-Yes. -Yes.

625
23:04.920 --> 23:05.720
Hurry, hurry.

626
23:17.220 --> 23:21.260
[Langyue Studio]

627
23:24.310 --> 23:25.200
Xiaoshan,

628
23:25.400 --> 23:27.830
why did you not dare to admit in front of General Sui Bing

629
23:27.830 --> 23:29.350
that the Dragon Saliva Crystal

630
23:29.350 --> 23:31.270
is in the Golden Dragon Pavilion?

631
23:31.960 --> 23:33.450
Could it be that

632
23:34.200 --> 23:35.310
you lied to me?

633
23:37.440 --> 23:38.480
Li Xiaosi,

634
23:38.920 --> 23:40.240
are you a fool?

635
23:41.030 --> 23:42.240
If Sui Bing knew

636
23:42.240 --> 23:43.440
about the Dragon Saliva Crystal,

637
23:43.440 --> 23:45.240
would you still be able to get it?

638
23:47.510 --> 23:48.640
So you were

639
23:48.960 --> 23:50.690
helping me guard the treasure.

640
23:51.350 --> 23:52.160
Of course.

641
23:53.510 --> 23:54.310
Let's go.

642
23:54.290 --> 23:56.240
[Langyue Studio]

643
24:08.590 --> 24:12.370
Sui Bing, Sui Bing.

644
24:15.160 --> 24:17.670
Sui Bing.

645
24:21.590 --> 24:22.640
I am Sui Bing,

646
24:23.400 --> 24:25.310
Commander of the Xuanjie Battalion.

647
24:25.310 --> 24:27.510
I did not know you had arrived, Golden Dragon God.

648
24:27.510 --> 24:28.570
Please forgive me.

649
24:28.920 --> 24:29.960
Spare my life.

650
24:30.350 --> 24:32.150
You have spent half your life in the military

651
24:32.150 --> 24:33.930
with great achievements.

652
24:34.310 --> 24:36.550
You are only in this miserable state

653
24:36.640 --> 24:38.440
because you were marginalized.

654
24:38.830 --> 24:40.560
What crime have you committed?

655
24:41.400 --> 24:44.530
I now bestow upon you a Dragon Saliva Crystal.

656
24:44.720 --> 24:47.160
Go and exchange it for a better future.

657
24:51.640 --> 24:53.570
This is the Dragon Saliva Crystal.

658
24:55.160 --> 24:56.350
Thank you, Golden Dragon God!

659
24:56.350 --> 24:58.010
Thank you, Golden Dragon God!

660
25:00.000 --> 25:01.060
Golden Dragon God!

661
25:04.310 --> 25:06.590
It was the Golden Dragon God coming to me in a dream just now.

662
25:06.590 --> 25:07.680
It gave me a hint.

663
25:08.790 --> 25:10.200
The Dragon Saliva Crystal

664
25:10.200 --> 25:11.860
spat from the dragon's mouth.

665
25:11.960 --> 25:14.490
It is indeed hidden in the Golden Dragon Hall.

666
25:15.180 --> 25:17.730
[Golden Dragon Hall]

667
25:25.400 --> 25:27.640
Will Sui come?

668
25:28.400 --> 25:29.870
I have already lit the Soul-Guiding Incense

669
25:29.870 --> 25:31.040
in his room.

670
25:32.110 --> 25:33.200
He will dream of

671
25:33.200 --> 25:34.530
whatever is on his mind.

672
25:34.830 --> 25:35.680
Therefore,

673
25:36.590 --> 25:37.990
he will definitely come.

674
25:38.440 --> 25:39.570
I don't understand.

675
25:44.310 --> 25:45.110
He is here.

676
25:48.960 --> 25:49.960
Should I go get

677
25:49.980 --> 25:51.640
Zhenzhu and the others to help?

678
25:51.640 --> 25:52.440
No need.

679
25:53.720 --> 25:54.720
You go back first

680
