38:52.760 --> 38:55.590
The case of Tang Wei and his son at Lanyue Pavilion.

1009
38:55.880 --> 38:56.800
No wonder.

1010
38:57.360 --> 38:59.000
He's blaming our bureau

1011
38:59.190 --> 39:01.150
for what happened to Tang Yiming.

1012
39:02.360 --> 39:03.150
What?

1013
39:03.360 --> 39:04.550
We're not allowed into Yunding Pavilion?

1014
39:04.550 --> 39:05.440
Didn't you tell them

1015
39:05.440 --> 39:06.550
that the Xuanjie Battalion is under imperial decree

1016
39:06.550 --> 39:07.360
to protect the Grand Heir Apparent?

1017
39:07.360 --> 39:08.150
I did,

1018
39:08.320 --> 39:09.720
and I gave them your name,

1019
39:09.800 --> 39:11.480
but the imperial guards still won't let us in.

1020
39:11.480 --> 39:12.280
Right now,

1021
39:12.320 --> 39:13.760
only Lord Huo is allowed inside.

1022
39:13.760 --> 39:16.020
Not even the personal eunuchs can enter.

1023
39:16.070 --> 39:17.480
This Huo Daozhang

1024
39:17.760 --> 39:19.710
dares to steal my credit?

1025
39:19.920 --> 39:21.080
He's too weak.

1026
39:21.100 --> 39:22.700
What the hell can he protect?

1027
39:26.030 --> 39:26.950
The Divine Constable Bureau

1028
39:26.950 --> 39:28.320
really is everywhere.

1029
39:28.320 --> 39:29.590
They actually let you in.

1030
39:29.590 --> 39:30.400
But in the future,

1031
39:30.400 --> 39:31.760
even if there are any benefits,

1032
39:31.760 --> 39:32.690
they'll fall on

1033
39:32.710 --> 39:33.880
your Chief.

1034
39:33.920 --> 39:36.120
Is it worth it for you two to work so hard?

1035
39:36.320 --> 39:37.230
Don't give me that crap

1036
39:37.230 --> 39:38.920
about it being your duty.

1037
39:39.150 --> 39:40.320
I'm telling you,

1038
39:40.360 --> 39:42.280
as long as I am here,

1039
39:42.550 --> 39:45.400
the Divine Constable Bureau will never be of any use.

1040
39:45.400 --> 39:46.920
And don't even think about showing off

1041
39:46.920 --> 39:48.070
in front of the Grand Heir Apparent.

1042
39:48.070 --> 39:49.670
When it comes to showing off,

1043
39:49.760 --> 39:51.760
who dares to compare with you?

1044
39:51.960 --> 39:53.800
But right now, I'm afraid you can't even enter

1045
39:53.800 --> 39:55.660
this Yunding Pavilion, General.

1046
39:55.670 --> 39:57.870
[Prosperous Times and Favourable Fortune]

1047
39:56.150 --> 39:57.880
I think you'd better figure out

1048
39:58.000 --> 39:59.320
how to get His Highness the Grand Heir Apparent

1049
39:59.320 --> 40:00.710
to see you.

1050
40:01.070 --> 40:02.870
Otherwise, even if you show off,

1051
40:02.970 --> 40:04.730
it'll be for nothing.

1052
40:04.760 --> 40:05.360
You...

1053
40:06.280 --> 40:08.110
What Ms. Bai said is...

1054
40:09.360 --> 40:10.420
absolutely right.

1055
40:14.190 --> 40:16.480
We still have important duties to attend to.

1056
40:16.480 --> 40:17.280
Farewell.

1057
40:17.130 --> 40:21.860
[Prosperous Times and Favourable Fortune]

1058
40:19.670 --> 40:20.600
Mr. Sui, Mr. Sui.

1059
40:20.800 --> 40:21.590
Let me.

1060
40:22.280 --> 40:23.320
It's just a mere Divine Constable Bureau!

1061
40:23.320 --> 40:25.000
What are you so arrogant about?

1062
40:25.000 --> 40:25.800
When these two

1063
40:25.800 --> 40:26.960
first came to Gutan County,

1064
40:26.960 --> 40:28.190
they bossed me around!

1065
40:28.190 --> 40:29.180
Especially that Yan Cheng.

1066
40:29.180 --> 40:30.800
I just didn't want to stoop to your level!

1067
40:30.800 --> 40:31.360
Of course,

1068
40:31.360 --> 40:34.020
I'm nowhere near as magnanimous as you, Mr. Sui.

1069
40:34.510 --> 40:35.630
Mr. Sui, just now,

1070
40:35.920 --> 40:37.400
in front of the Minister,

1071
40:37.670 --> 40:40.110
thank you for helping me out.

1072
40:40.480 --> 40:42.000
A mere Huo Daozhang

1073
40:42.000 --> 40:43.320
is nothing to worry about.

1074
40:43.320 --> 40:44.230
Yes, yes, yes.

1075
40:44.480 --> 40:45.810
Nothing to worry about.

1076
40:47.400 --> 40:48.190
Mr. Sui,

1077
40:48.280 --> 40:49.920
any clues about

1078
40:49.920 --> 40:51.450
the Dragon Saliva Crystal?

1079
40:52.480 --> 40:54.000
In my opinion,

1080
40:54.360 --> 40:55.540
given the current situation,

1081
40:55.540 --> 40:57.230
if we have the crystal in hand,

1082
40:57.360 --> 40:58.440
wouldn't you

1083
40:58.510 --> 41:00.800
be more certain of victory?

1084
41:02.920 --> 41:04.760
It's easier said than done

1085
41:04.760 --> 41:06.110
to make the Golden Dragon Pavilion spit out the crystal.

1086
41:06.110 --> 41:07.030
Now Huo Daozhang

1087
41:07.030 --> 41:08.320
won't let me into the Yunding Pavilion.

1088
41:08.320 --> 41:09.030
He must be plotting with

1089
41:09.030 --> 41:10.230
that old man Yun Hai

1090
41:10.400 --> 41:13.200
to present the crystal to the Grand Heir Apparent!

1091
41:13.480 --> 41:14.550
I think Lord Huo

1092
41:14.550 --> 41:15.710
makes some sense.

1093
41:15.760 --> 41:18.000
The shadow puppet murderer didn't strike earlier or later,

1094
41:18.000 --> 41:19.440
but right at this critical moment

1095
41:19.440 --> 41:20.670
of the blessing ceremony.

1096
41:20.670 --> 41:21.670
Maybe they are targeting

1097
41:21.670 --> 41:23.150
the Grand Heir Apparent.

1098
41:23.960 --> 41:24.880
Anyway,

1099
41:24.910 --> 41:25.550
we must ensure

1100
41:25.550 --> 41:26.760
the safety of the Grand Heir Apparent.

1101
41:26.760 --> 41:27.670
We'll stand guard

1102
41:27.670 --> 41:28.590
at the Golden Dragon Pavilion today,

1103
41:28.590 --> 41:29.320
just in case.

1104
41:29.320 --> 41:29.960
Okay.

1105
41:55.920 --> 41:57.180
Li Si might be

1106
41:57.510 --> 41:58.800
secretly watching us

1107
41:58.800 --> 42:00.260
from somewhere right now.

1108
42:00.760 --> 42:01.710
Qingyang

1109
42:02.150 --> 42:03.880
is really lucky.

1110
42:06.710 --> 42:08.320
If Meng Rui knew,

1111
42:08.800 --> 42:10.280
he would be so happy.

1112
42:10.510 --> 42:11.590
Should we send

1113
42:11.590 --> 42:13.590
a pigeon message back to the bureau?

1114
42:14.150 --> 42:15.670
Have you ever thought about

1115
42:15.670 --> 42:17.110
how Li Si survived

1116
42:17.760 --> 42:19.510
after being stabbed and falling off the cliff?

1117
42:19.510 --> 42:20.840
And who is most likely

1118
42:20.880 --> 42:22.410
to have lent a helping hand?

1119
42:22.760 --> 42:23.920
The Chief.

1120
42:23.920 --> 42:25.150
And I think

1121
42:25.670 --> 42:26.920
Li Si's visit this time

1122
42:26.920 --> 42:28.670
was also instructed by the Chief.

1123
42:28.670 --> 42:30.320
As for whether to tell Meng Rui,

1124
42:30.320 --> 42:32.000
let Li Si decide for himself.

1125
42:32.360 --> 42:34.220
Besides, we still have the Chief.

1126
42:34.320 --> 42:35.280
You're the one

1127
42:35.510 --> 42:36.760
who thinks things through.

1128
42:36.760 --> 42:37.550
I was just

1129
42:38.480 --> 42:40.000
too busy being happy.

1130
42:40.510 --> 42:41.800
I just hope

1131
42:42.190 --> 42:43.150
the blessing ceremony

1132
42:43.150 --> 42:44.400
goes smoothly this time.

1133
42:44.400 --> 42:45.800
I wonder if the Grand Heir Apparent

1134
42:45.800 --> 42:47.530
was frightened during the day.

1135
42:47.550 --> 42:48.760
I promised the Crown Princess

1136
42:48.760 --> 42:50.090
to take good care of him.

1137
42:56.710 --> 42:57.800
Do you feel that

1138
42:58.360 --> 43:00.670
it's exceptionally cold tonight?

1139
43:23.920 --> 43:24.780
Your Highness,

1140
43:24.960 --> 43:26.800
you will be fasting tomorrow.

1141
43:27.360 --> 43:28.920
Please eat a little more.

1142
43:34.190 --> 43:36.190
The Emperor's health is important.

1143
43:36.280 --> 43:37.920
Your health

1144
43:38.510 --> 43:40.000
is equally important.

1145
43:40.480 --> 43:43.190
Please eat a little more.

1146
43:47.270 --> 43:52.040
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

1147
43:55.000 --> 43:55.800
General,

1148
43:55.960 --> 43:57.550
you have been patrolling all day.

1149
43:57.550 --> 43:58.880
Please go back and rest.

1150
43:59.280 --> 44:00.400
Leave this to us.

1151
44:02.690 --> 44:04.810
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

1152
44:16.850 --> 44:17.970
[Prosperous Times and Favourable Fortune]

1153
44:20.710 --> 44:21.510
General,

1154
44:21.510 --> 44:22.570
what is happening?

1155
44:23.070 --> 44:25.070
I fear something is about to happen.

1156
44:26.070 --> 44:26.880
Zexi.

1157
44:26.880 --> 44:27.590
Here.

1158
44:27.590 --> 44:29.070
You must secure the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

1159
44:29.070 --> 44:30.110
If there are enemies,

1160
44:30.110 --> 44:31.070
capture them all.

1161
44:31.070 --> 44:31.800
Understood.

1162
44:36.200 --> 44:37.680
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]
